# The owner's ruling of 2026-11-21 (docs/engine-design.md, "Taking back an illegal action"): a cast given up reveals and
# moves nothing hidden. Bolas's Citadel casts Bone Splinters off the top of the library for 1 life, which Ashiok, Wicked
# Manipulator would replace with exiling the next card, Lightning Bolt (CR 119.4, 614.1a); that is carried out only as
# the cast is committed. The cast is given up at the question of which creature to sacrifice: it is taken back (CR 733.1) -
# Bone Splinters back on top of the library, nothing sacrificed - and nothing was ever exiled: the Bolt is still in the
# library, under Bone Splinters, and the life is 20.

